---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="ConnectFlow privacy policy (draft).">
  <div class="wrap page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></div>
  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="callout">Draft for review. This text is a starting template and must be reviewed by a qualified lawyer before ConnectFlow is offered to the public.</div>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Account details (name, email, company), the leads and conversations you add or generate in your workspace, usage and audit logs, and technical data needed to run the service.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>To operate the service, secure it, provide support and bill you. Your workspace data is isolated from other customers and is not used to serve them.</p>
      <h2>AI processing</h2>
      <p>Lead and conversation text may be sent to AI providers to draft messages. We send only what is needed for the task.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can export or delete your data. Contact us to exercise privacy rights.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
